-- 𝑻𝒓𝒂𝒗𝒆𝒍 widens from landscapes to local life and elegant portraits. The description and the
-- brief change only where an admin has not edited them since 0006.
UPDATE topics SET description = '世界各地在 X 上分享的风景、人文与当地人像，以及目的地的历史文化导读', updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'travel' AND description = '世界各地旅行者在 X 上分享的旅途照片与亲身感受，以及目的地的历史文化导读';
UPDATE topics SET brief = $new$中文：从 X 上挑选世界各地的旅途分享：在当地拍摄的照片和发帖人自己的文字，覆盖风景（自然风光、城市街巷、建筑古迹）、人文（当地生活、美食市集、节庆与手艺），以及成年女性身着传统服饰或时装、在写明名称的地方拍摄的优雅人像，兼顾各大洲；发帖人可以是旅行者、摄影师、模特或当地居民。照片清晰好看、让人想去。排除转发他人照片的聚合账号、广告、AI 生成图、泳装内衣或刻意性感的照片、路人街拍与偷拍、以儿童为主体或私密的照片，以及正文没有写明地点的帖子。
English: Pick travel posts from across the world on X: photographs taken on the spot with the poster's own words, covering landscapes (nature, streets, architecture and heritage), local life (food and markets, festivals and crafts) and elegant portraits of adult women in traditional dress or fashion at a named place, on every continent, by travelers, photographers, models or locals. Photographs are clear, beautiful and make people want to go. Exclude aggregators reposting others' photographs, ads, AI-generated images, swimwear, lingerie or deliberately sexy shots, candid shots of strangers, photographs centered on children or private moments, and posts whose text does not name the place.$new$, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'travel' AND brief = $old$中文：从 X 上挑选世界各地的旅途分享：在当地拍摄的照片和发帖人自己的文字，覆盖自然风光、城市街巷、建筑古迹、美食市集、节庆与当地生活，兼顾各大洲；发帖人可以是旅行者、摄影爱好者或当地居民。照片以地方为主角，清晰好看、让人想去。排除转发他人照片的聚合账号、广告、AI 生成图、以儿童为主体或私密的照片，以及正文没有写明地点的帖子。
English: Pick travel posts from across the world on X: photographs taken on the spot with the poster's own words, covering landscapes, streets, architecture and heritage, food and markets, festivals and local life on every continent, by travelers, photographers or locals. The place is the subject; photographs are clear, beautiful and make people want to go. Exclude aggregators reposting others' photographs, ads, AI-generated images, photographs centered on children or private moments, and posts whose text does not name the place.$old$;
